      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲉⲓϣⲁⲛⲧⲛⲧⲱⲛⲅ ⲉⲓⲱⲥⲏⲫ **ⲁⲕⲙⲓϣⲉ **ⲟⲩⲃⲉ**ⲙⲡⲁⲑⲟⲥ** ⲛⲧⲉϥϩⲉ ·",
      "english": "I compare thee unto Joseph, because thou didst fight against passion, even as did he.",
